The road to success starts with the concept summary and new venture story.
Once an entrepreneur has decided to act upon a business opportunity, it is impor-
tant to prepare a concept summary of the new venture. This summary can be
a simple statement of the problem being addressed and how the venture will
solve it. Table 6.2 gives the elements of the concept summary. For example, the
